<XuiHtmlElement>
<Properties>
<Id>XuiHtmlElement1</Id>
<Width>544.000000</Width>
<Height>352.000000</Height>
<Position>24.000000,56.000000,0.000000</Position>
<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
These demonstration pages will take you through some of the most commonly used controls in XuiTool.&#xD;
To run this demo, press the F5 key or click the 'File &gt; Preview' menu option.&#xD;
Do this now...&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;br/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;font size=8&gt;&#xD;
&lt;br/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/font&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;table&gt;&#xD;
&lt;tr&gt;&#xD;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;td width="86%" bgcolor="#808080"&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;font size=5&gt;&#xD;
&lt;br/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/font&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;font color="#FFFFFF" size=10&gt;&#xD;
To navigate through the controls/pages, you can use any of the following:&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;li&gt;The arrow keys on your keyboard, along with the A/B/X/Y keys&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;li&gt;The mouse cursor, and the left mouse button&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;li&gt;An Xbox 360 controller connected to your PC&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;/font&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/td&gt;&#xD;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/tr&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/table&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;font size=8&gt;&#xD;
&lt;br/&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/font&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
All controls can be skinned using &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visuals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; from a skin file.&#xD;
For instance, this is how you would create two &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Button&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; controls that look completely different from one another.&#xD;
If the &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; property isn't specified for a control, it will use a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; with the same name as the control's class (ie. &lt;i&gt;XuiButton&lt;/i&gt;).&#xD;
To see the &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visuals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; being used in this demonstration, run the 'File &gt; Open' menu option and select the &lt;i&gt;skin_default.xui&lt;/i&gt; file.&#xD;
&lt;/font&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
</Text>
</Properties>
</XuiHtmlElement>
